Perhaps the warnings were a bit more subtle than the original poster
desired.  I remember reading in specific the deadliness of the Medusa
and the eels.  Both of these situations, IMHO, provide sufficient
warning.  To wit:
   Medusa -- a large plethora of Statues.  There are at least seven
statues on that level, and most of them are in the vicinity of the
lady herself.  Seeing that other things have already been stoned
should be a clue.
   eels -- these always appear in Deep water.  Therefore, if you see
deep water, you should know to be careful.  Sure, the eels may still
strike without warning, but the situation does not come out of the blue.
You most definitely have enough time to take the appropriate precautions.
