A while back I proposed that the prayer timeout for wishes, etc. should
depend on what you wished for.  Your god wouldn't mind handing you a
blindfold, but Stormbringer would be a large demand -- don't expect
help from him any time soon.  Furthermore, the size of the prayer
timeout remaining might influence whether a wish is granted.
"I just gave you Stormbringer -- no way are you getting Excalibur now"
